# cliphist config: one `key value` per line. Options and defaults:
# https://github.com/sentriz/cliphist#configuration
# The values below are the defaults, written out so they're easy to tune.

# Oldest entries are dropped past this. Images count as one item each.
max-items 20

# How many recent items to check for a duplicate before storing a new one.
max-dedupe-search 100
